  "answer_text": "Domino's offers a mix of limited-time promo codes, nationally running deals, and reward opportunities. \n\n### \ud83d\udea8 Limited-Time Alert (Ending Today!)\n* **50% Off All Menu-Priced Pizzas:** Today (**June 7, 2026**) is the final day of Domino\u2019s National Dairy Month promotion. You can get **50% off any pizza at menu price**. No promo code is required\u2014just click the offer banner directly on the homepage, in the app, or under the \"Coupons\" tab to apply it to your order.\n\n---\n\n### Active Promo Codes\nWhile many Domino's codes are location-dependent, these active codes have the highest success rates nationwide:\n* **`35OFF`** \u2013 **35% off your entire order**. (Highly popular and verified to work at checkout in most U.S. locations).\n* **`50OFF`** \u2013 **50% off your order** (Only valid at select participating franchise locations).\n\n---\n\n### National Everyday Deals (No Code Required)\nIf you are ordering online or in the app, you can add these popular national deals directly from the **\"Deals\"** or **\"Coupons\"** tab:\n* **Mix & Match Deal ($6.99 each):** Choose any two or more items (such as medium 2-topping pizzas, sandwiches, pastas, stuffed cheesy bread, or desserts) for **$6.99 each**. \n* **Carryout Special ($7.99):** Get a large 1-topping pizza, 8-piece wings, or a Dips & Twists combo for **$7.99**. *(Must select carryout at checkout)*.\n* **The Perfect Combo ($19.99):** Get two medium 1-topping pizzas, a 16-piece order of Parmesan Bread Bites, an 8-piece order of Cinnamon Twists, and a 2-liter soda for **$19.99**.\n* **Parmesan Stuffed Crust Pizza ($10.99):** Get a Parmesan Stuffed Crust pizza for **$10.99**.\n\n---\n\n### Freebies & Promos\n* **Free Slice Sauce (Through June 14, 2026):** Get a free dipping \"Slice Sauce\" when you purchase any Handmade Pan or Parmesan Stuffed Crust pizza online or in-app. \n* **Emergency Pizza for Soccer (Register by June 10, 2026):** If you are a Domino's Rewards member, register at *dominos.com/emergency-pizzas-for-soccer*. Every time a player on a U.S. soccer team gets a red card during the current international tournament, Domino\u2019s will randomly give away over 60,000 free medium two-topping \"Emergency Pizzas\".\n\n---\n\n### Tips for Maximizing Savings\n1. **Check Local Coupons first:** Because Domino's stores are mostly franchised, the very best deals are often highly localized. Always type in your ZIP code on [dominos.com](https://www.dominos.com) and click the **Coupons** tab to see exclusive deals for your nearest store. \n2. **Student Discounts:** If you are a student, you can verify your status via **UNiDAYS** to get a student discount of up to 35% to 50% off.\n3. **Join Domino\u2019s Rewards:** You earn 10 points for every order over $10. Once you reach 60 points, you can redeem them for a **free medium 2-topping pizza**.",
